' Printing past the last row scrolls the whole screen up - when the next character comes, not at the
' line feed, so the last line printed stays on row 23 (semantics annex: print-position)
'@expect screen 0 "Line 6"
'@expect screen 22 "Line 28"
'@expect screen 23 "Line 29"
DIM i AS UByte
FOR i = 0 TO 29
 PRINT "Line "; i
NEXT i
